# Fixture bytes are semantic: HOCON triple-quoted strings preserve CR/CRLF
# verbatim (S9.2), and several fixtures pin exact line endings. Never let git
# convert line endings in these trees (GitHub's Windows runners set
# core.autocrlf=true, which used to CRLF-ify checkouts — masked, until
# go#196, by the lexer's spec-deviating CRLF normalization).
testdata/** -text
adapters/testdata-format-ingestion/** -text
